Z||000004||sluppy123||01-25-2001||05:35 PM||||DXR_Dad- I removed all the old headliner and padding then used 3M Foam Fast 74 to glue up the vinyl. I used alot of glue, working from the center out, contouring the vinyl to the curves.(I also used a little heat to soften the vinyl up a bit, and remove any wrinkles)<P>Brian||||reg||1
